Z||000009||FIEROCIOUS||09-18-2000||01:20 AM||||Centerforce could care less whos money they take be it Archie or Bostitch's! Goto Centerforce's web site! the P/N for the clutch-TO bearing is: DF 201914<BR>Flywheel P/N are<BR>2 pc seal 85 and earlier: 700502<BR>1 pc seal 86 and later: 700501<P>GM part numbers:<BR>14088650 1pc seal<BR>14085720 2pc seal<p>[This message has been edited by FIEROCIOUS (edited 09-19-2000).]||||reg||1
